              "enchanted_comb",
              "enchanted_soap",
              "enchanted_towel",
              "enchanted_towel"
            ],
            "fork": false
          }
        ],
        "next": "A Private Bath",
        "prompt": "As you enter the Bathhouse proper, you are immediately assaulted by what appears to be a selection of malfunctioning, yet still magical, bath accessories."
      },
      {
        "id": "Fight the Doorman",
        "type": "combat",
        "monster_groups": [
          {
            "monsters": [
              "gnome_doorman"
            ],
            "fork": false
          }
        ],
        "next": "The Bathhouse",
        "prompt": "\"YOU AGAIN?  OH HOW I HAVE WAITED FOR THIS MOMENT.  YOU MAY HAVE GOT ME FIRED FROM MY LAST JOB, BUT I HAVE BEEN TRAINING EVERY WAKING MOMENT FOR THE CHANCE THAT I GET MY REVENGE\"\r\n\r\nThe Gnome...er.... Goblin's dorky, nasal voice is really starting to grate on your nerves.\r\n\r\n\"EN GARDE, MY NEMESIS.\"\r\n\r\nOh that is -it-."
      },
      {
        "id": "A desperate choice!",
        "type": "choice",
