            "y": 87.0
          }
        ],
        "next": "A desperate choice!",
        "prompt": "As you remove the curtains to enter in what you think is the main room, it turns out you stumble into a private bath!"
      },
      {
        "id": "Witch Meltdown",
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "The Frustrated Witch lies slumped against the tub, wheezing. Behind her, the floating bath apparatus she'd been wrangling all fight is now completely unsupervised and spinning wildly out of control as they spray suds -everywhere-.",
        "actions": [
          {
            "label": "Help her wrangle it",
            "check": {
              "stat": "atk",
              "dc": 35
            },
            "on_success": {
              "next": "A desperate choice!",
              "message": "Between the two of you, you wrestle the apparatus back under control. She glares at you, snatching it back. \"Thanks... I guess. Don't think this makes us friends.  The next time I see you, I'm still kicking your ass.\"",
              "achievement_kind": "bath_witch_befriended"
            },
            "on_fail": {
              "next": "A desperate choice!",
              "hp_delta": -10,
              "message": "You lunge for it. It does not want to be caught. It backhands you with what you can only describe as soap-slicked vengeance."
            },
            "x": 1487.0,
            "y": 234.0
          },
          {
            "label": "Leave her to it",
            "on_success": {
              "next": "A desperate choice!",
              "message": "You decide this is not your problem and step over her, leaving her to fight the apparatus alone. Her muffled cursing follows you out."
            },
            "x": 1235.0,
            "y": 199.0
          }
        ],
        "background_path": "assets/dungeon/backgrounds/gnome_bathhouse_room_Witch Meltdown.gif"
      },
      {
        "id": "Sneaky Hobos",
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "You stop to catch your breath -- and notice you're not alone. A ragged group of hobos is huddled in the corner around a suspiciously well-organized dice game, using what you can only assume are stolen towels as a table cloth.",
        "actions": [
          {
            "label": "Tattle on them",
            "check": {
              "chance": 0.6
            },
            "on_success": {
              "next": "A desperate choice!",
              "message": "You flag down a bathhouse attendant and quietly point out the hobos. They slip you a little something for your trouble before hauling the group off, muttering about \"freeloaders.\"",
              "currency_delta": 50
            },
            "on_fail": {
              "next": "Angry Gnomes",
              "message": "The attendant squints at you, then at the huddled hobos, then back at you. \"Wait... you're the one that's been causing trouble.\""
            },
            "x": 1233.0,
            "y": 786.0
          },
          {
            "label": "GAMBLE!!",
            "cost": {
              "currency": 50
            },
            "check": {
              "chance": 0.5
            },
            "on_success": {
              "next": "A desperate choice!",
              "message": "You buy in and snatch the dice before any hobo can do their hobo hexes on them.  You blow on them and throw them down.  Seven!  That's a winner!",
              "currency_delta": 100
            },
            "on_fail": {
              "next": "A desperate choice!",
              "message": "You buy in, but once the game starts the hobo's hands move so fast you can't even see what is happening.  Before you know it, you've lost.  You suspect the dice were never fair to begin with."
            },
            "x": 1136.0,
            "y": 575.0
          }
        ]
      },
